flowchart TD
    UPLOAD["1. Patient uploads prescription<br/>Image or PDF"]
    VALIDATE["2. Backend validates file<br/>Type and upload constraints"]
    PDF{"PDF file?"}
    RENDER["Render PDF pages<br/>Up to first 3 pages"]
    VISION["3. Vision model extracts medicine fields"]
    SCHEMA["4. Validate extracted output<br/>Against medication schema"]
    NORMALIZE["5. Normalize medicine names<br/>Brand names → generic ingredients"]
    CHECK["6. Check recognized ingredient pairs<br/>Against interaction dataset"]
    REPLY["7. Generate grounded template reply"]
    SAVE["Save prescription, medicines,<br/>and reply to the database"]

    UPLOAD --> VALIDATE --> PDF
    PDF -->|Yes| RENDER --> VISION
    PDF -->|No — image| VISION
    VISION --> SCHEMA --> NORMALIZE --> CHECK --> REPLY --> SAVE

